WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.969
Namaste. Is video mein transport ke naye kaam dekhenge.

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:17.462
Har maal ki bilty yaani LR, raaste se delivery tak uska status, grahak ke liye tracking link, bhade ka bill, aur har gaadi ka diesel, toll aur bhatte ka kharcha, aur gaadi ka asli munafa.

00:00:17.462 --> 00:00:19.771
Ye transport ka public demo hai.

00:00:20.106 --> 00:00:28.059
Transport ke menu mein ab chaar cheezein hain: Bilty, gaadi ka kharcha, gaadiyan, aur gaadi ka munafa.

00:00:28.059 --> 00:00:35.077
Bilty kholte hain. Yahan raaste mein, pahunch chuki, aur bill baaki, sab alag dikhti hain.

00:00:35.631 --> 00:00:40.230
Nayi bilty. Gaadi chunte hain, driver ka naam aur phone.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:48.195
Maal bhejne wali party purani hai, to list se chun li. Lene wala naya hai, to bas naam aur phone.

00:00:48.195 --> 00:00:51.562
Phir kahan se kahan, maal, nag aur wazan.

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:56.052
Bhada chaudah hazaar aur loading ke paanch sau.

00:00:56.052 --> 00:01:08.340
Bhada kaun dega: Paid, yaani bhejne wala abhi dega; To pay, yaani lene wala delivery par; ya To be billed, yaani mahine ke ant mein ek bill.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:12.817
Ye party mahine ka bill leti hai. Book and make LR.

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:19.406
LR ban gaya, apne number ke saath. Gaadi nikli to Dispatched dabate hain.

00:01:19.406 --> 00:01:26.209
Maal pahuncha to Mark delivered, kisne liya, aur koi baat ho to note. Delivered.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:32.718
WhatsApp to receiver dabane par lene wale ko poori bilty aur ek tracking link jaata hai.

00:01:32.718 --> 00:01:38.516
Link kholne par wo dekhta hai maal kahan hai: booked, raaste mein, ya pahunch gaya.

00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:41.101
Phone number is page par nahi dikhte.

00:01:41.463 --> 00:01:49.754
Print ya PDF mein bilty ki chaar copy: bhejne wale ki, lene wale ki, driver ki aur office ki.

00:01:50.941 --> 00:01:56.911
Is trip ka kharcha bhi bilty par hi likhte hain. Toll chhe sau chaalis, UPI se.

00:01:56.911 --> 00:02:00.992
Bilty par dikhta hai kitna kharch hua aur kitna bacha.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:07.330
Diesel ka kharcha Vehicle expenses mein. Kitne litre aur meter reading bhi likhte hain.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:12.864
Har baar tank full karke meter likhein, to app gaadi ka average khud nikalta hai.

00:02:12.864 --> 00:02:16.758
Ye kharcha usi din ke galle ke hisaab mein bhi jaata hai.

00:02:17.146 --> 00:02:22.495
Mahine ke ant mein, Not billed tab. Party ke hisaab se saari bilty.

00:02:22.495 --> 00:02:26.647
Pick all, aur ek hi bill ban jaata hai, udhaar mein.

00:02:26.647 --> 00:02:31.597
Voh bill void ho, to bilty phir bill baaki mein aa jaati hain.

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:41.337
Aur Vehicle profit mein har gaadi ki kamai, har kharcha, munafa, har kilometre ka kharcha aur diesel average.

00:02:41.337 --> 00:02:46.040
Kaunsi gaadi kama rahi hai, kaunsi nuksaan, turant dikhta hai.

00:02:46.412 --> 00:02:58.431
To transport ke liye: bilty se delivery tak ka status, grahak ko tracking link, trip ka kharcha, mahine ka ek bill, aur har gaadi ka asli munafa.

00:02:58.431 --> 00:02:59.343
Dhanyavaad.
